WEBVTT

00:03.090 --> 00:04.960
Hey, did you hear about that guy?

00:04.960 --> 00:06.020
What? What?

00:06.020 --> 00:09.240
He goes to that nasty old temple every 
day to do training or something.

00:09.240 --> 00:11.120
Are you kidding?

00:11.120 --> 00:12.760
What a weirdo!

00:14.270 --> 00:15.570
Training?

00:27.290 --> 00:29.970
He really is training!

00:37.060 --> 00:39.020
Watch out!

00:41.230 --> 00:42.360
You okay?

00:43.650 --> 00:48.030
What are you doing? There's no way a shrimp 
like you could take something like that.

00:49.250 --> 00:51.790
I'm trying to become a Honki Person.

00:51.790 --> 00:52.910
Honki Person?

00:52.910 --> 00:55.980
Someone who never runs away, no matter what.

00:56.410 --> 00:58.400
That's a Honki Person.

01:01.420 --> 01:02.600
I'm in!

01:03.380 --> 01:05.010
I'll train with you!

01:14.470 --> 01:15.640
This is for you.

01:19.640 --> 01:21.270
Ma

01:19.640 --> 01:21.270
Ara

01:19.640 --> 01:21.270
Jin

01:19.640 --> 01:21.270
Takara

01:19.640 --> 01:23.520
Wow! That's so cool!

01:28.150 --> 01:29.780
It's a best friend stone.

01:29.780 --> 01:32.030
Let's become Honki People together, okay?

01:34.780 --> 01:35.920
Yeah!

01:43.090 --> 01:45.540
Let's merge, Senya.

01:45.540 --> 01:50.510
You heard what Shindo said! 
If we merge all the way, you could die!

01:50.510 --> 01:52.010
Shut the hell up!

01:52.940 --> 01:55.090
There's no way I'm gonna die.

01:55.650 --> 01:59.210
I'm only doing it to force him to wake up.

02:00.270 --> 02:04.400
<b>#12 Fateful Duel! Beyond the Gyoza Dumplings</b>

02:00.490 --> 02:02.770
Kenchin-sama, please hold on!

02:03.170 --> 02:09.260
In the next life, we shall 
meet again on the Caspian Sea.

02:10.670 --> 02:12.780
K-K...

02:12.780 --> 02:15.780
Kenchin-sama!

02:16.970 --> 02:20.150
Arajin, just listen to this...

02:22.700 --> 02:24.670
Where could he be at this hour?

02:25.370 --> 02:26.670
Sleeping over!

02:27.080 --> 02:28.200
Which means...

02:33.010 --> 02:37.610
<i>It's like Matakara has turned 
into a totally different person.</i>

02:37.610 --> 02:39.190
<i>What happened to him?</i>

02:39.570 --> 02:42.460
You should stay home and take it easy, man.

02:42.460 --> 02:46.060
I can't lay around doing nothing 
when Siguma's in so much trouble.

02:46.600 --> 02:49.370
By the way, where's Arajin-kun?

02:49.370 --> 02:52.280
Who cares? It's not like he 
does anything when he's here.

02:52.590 --> 02:53.900
Arajin?

02:54.760 --> 02:57.460
He might know something about this.

02:58.210 --> 03:00.460
Whew! I'm stuffed.

03:00.460 --> 03:02.920
Did they say it was gonna rain today?

03:02.920 --> 03:03.930
No.

03:04.700 --> 03:07.420
Doesn't that look bad?

03:08.360 --> 03:10.000
Yeah, real bad.

03:21.390 --> 03:23.840
I've finally taken control.

03:24.730 --> 03:28.810
Senya, it is time for our final confrontation.

03:30.020 --> 03:33.810
There we go. All done.

03:34.450 --> 03:37.820
Sure sucks that those punks 
jumped you like that.

03:38.320 --> 03:39.320
Shut up.

03:39.810 --> 03:41.850
Anyway, where's Matakara?

03:41.850 --> 03:45.830
I don't know. After the fight, 
he ran off somewhere.

03:48.080 --> 03:49.630
Let's find him.

03:49.630 --> 03:53.720
Find him? But you're too 
messed up to go anywhere.

03:57.090 --> 03:59.840
Big Brother, I brought you a Maji Kebab.

04:05.580 --> 04:07.570
I'm going outside for a minute, okay?

04:11.010 --> 04:14.340
The patient from the evening had 
three times the normal anesthetic dose,

04:14.340 --> 04:15.760
and it still had no effect.

04:15.760 --> 04:19.250
What? Is he some kind of 
gorilla or something?

04:19.890 --> 04:21.050
Gorilla?

04:28.580 --> 04:30.820
Man, that was so messed up.

04:30.820 --> 04:32.370
Yeah.

04:34.250 --> 04:36.130
Welcome in!

04:36.130 --> 04:39.890
Oh! You sure are looking sharp today!

04:40.570 --> 04:41.850
Jasmine-chan, please.

04:41.850 --> 04:45.100
All right! One happy birthday 
serving of Jasmine-chan!

04:45.490 --> 04:50.210
I don't need anything else. 
Because I have you, Jasmine-chan!

04:50.210 --> 04:52.990
I came to get you on this, the day of your birth.

04:52.990 --> 04:54.940
P-P-P...

04:54.940 --> 04:57.420
Please be mine forever!

04:58.050 --> 05:00.110
Huh? Sir, wait!

05:04.090 --> 05:05.950
What the...

05:04.090 --> 05:05.950
Hold it!

05:05.950 --> 05:07.950
Jasmine

05:05.950 --> 05:07.950
<b>Would you let her supreme 
magic fulfill all of your desires?</b>

05:05.950 --> 05:07.950
Pu'er

05:13.240 --> 05:15.300
I'll bring you a banana later,

05:15.300 --> 05:19.280
so just take it easy here for a while, 
okay, Triple Fundoshi Gorilla-san?

05:19.720 --> 05:22.950
Oh, didn't you have a human name, too?

05:22.950 --> 05:26.890
Something like... Doman Kenichiro?

05:27.730 --> 05:32.350
Ken... ichiro?

05:42.860 --> 05:44.920
Big Brother!

05:46.360 --> 05:47.830
Red beans and rice.

05:47.830 --> 05:50.030
Congrats to you, congrats to you, 
here's red beans and—

05:50.030 --> 05:51.070
Excuse me.

05:51.460 --> 05:53.670
Are you Arajin's friends?

05:53.670 --> 05:56.860
I'm so sorry. He isn't here right now.

05:56.860 --> 05:58.670
Do you know where he went?

05:59.670 --> 06:02.420
To win a once-in-a-lifetime battle.

06:03.490 --> 06:04.900
Let's go, Outa-kun.

06:05.510 --> 06:06.760
You can't!

06:07.280 --> 06:11.430
It's a nighttime battle of mind and body 
that must be fought by the two of them alone.

06:12.030 --> 06:14.140
You can understand that, right?

06:15.900 --> 06:18.770
There comes a time in a boy's life 
when he has to stand his ground!

06:19.080 --> 06:21.400
When he has to stand and fight!

06:21.400 --> 06:25.340
Please, let my boy become a man!

06:38.040 --> 06:39.290
Matakara.

06:39.290 --> 06:42.070
He's been taken over completely.

06:42.070 --> 06:45.320
That isn't Matakara anymore. It's Ichiya!

06:49.850 --> 06:54.700
Let's merge. You waited all this time 
to settle things with him, right?

06:55.160 --> 06:57.020
Are you sure about this?

06:57.020 --> 06:58.900
Hurry up and get on with it!

07:00.650 --> 07:03.580
Fine! Then tell me what you wish for!

07:03.900 --> 07:08.770
I want to make Matakara wake up!

07:08.770 --> 07:11.750
Bucchigiri!

07:17.260 --> 07:19.170
Arajin! Hey!

07:19.170 --> 07:21.210
Answer me, Arajin!

07:21.680 --> 07:24.160
Was that the wrong choice after all?

07:25.050 --> 07:27.340
Didn't you say you wouldn't let me take over?

07:27.340 --> 07:28.770
Damn it!

07:28.770 --> 07:32.780
Three hundred years. 
It has been a while, Senya.

07:32.780 --> 07:36.100
I expect you are sufficiently 
prepared for this.

07:36.610 --> 07:39.790
Ichiya. Why do you resent me?

07:39.790 --> 07:42.980
Why did you risk your life 
in a real battle with me then?

07:42.980 --> 07:46.840
Fight me. That is where 
you shall find your answer.

08:08.220 --> 08:08.890
Come on!

08:08.890 --> 08:11.550
Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on!

08:18.210 --> 08:19.220
Get up.

08:21.220 --> 08:22.500
Come on!

08:29.370 --> 08:30.700
Get up!

08:39.830 --> 08:41.130
<i>I can't beat him.</i>

08:45.460 --> 08:50.300
<i>You inspired me and made me 
want to become a Honki Person.</i>

08:50.830 --> 08:54.120
<i>I wanted to become strong, just like you.</i>

08:54.560 --> 08:58.060
<i>So how could I possibly beat—</i>

09:01.810 --> 09:07.400
You asked me why I risked my life 
to face you in a true fight then.

09:11.820 --> 09:14.160
I was running out of time.

09:14.730 --> 09:20.040
If disease was going to kill me anyway, 
I wanted to die by your hand!

09:23.560 --> 09:28.300
But now there is no other choice. 
Let us end it all.

09:28.910 --> 09:34.300
<i>Even now, at the end, I still wasn't 
able to give you what you wanted.</i>

09:35.250 --> 09:38.870
<i>I'm sorry, Ichiya.</i>

09:43.480 --> 09:46.900
Senya. Senya. Senya.

09:46.900 --> 09:47.820
Senya!

09:49.130 --> 09:51.030
Arajin! You're still aliv—

09:52.110 --> 09:54.480
What the hell are you doing?!

09:55.930 --> 09:58.830
I can't beat Ichiya.

09:58.830 --> 10:01.500
Screw that! Start fighting for real!

10:01.500 --> 10:03.040
I always fight for real!

10:03.040 --> 10:05.250
Then you can't give up now!

10:05.560 --> 10:07.130
Shut up.

10:07.130 --> 10:09.000
Start fighting for real!

10:09.400 --> 10:10.880
Shut up.

10:10.880 --> 10:13.840
Quit running away, Senya!

10:14.720 --> 10:17.980
Shut up!

10:32.440 --> 10:33.650
Senya!

10:37.920 --> 10:40.890
There's nowhere left to look!

10:40.890 --> 10:43.750
Matakara has to be somewhere in town.

10:44.040 --> 10:48.060
Yeah, but we've already 
looked everywhere we can.

10:48.060 --> 10:48.790
Hey!

10:50.610 --> 10:51.920
What the heck is that?

10:53.420 --> 10:54.460
Let's go, Koma!

10:54.460 --> 10:56.550
Roger dodger, leave it to me!

10:57.180 --> 10:58.480
<i>Matakara!</i>

11:03.740 --> 11:07.310
<i>I got stronger than anyone else.</i>

11:07.870 --> 11:09.090
<i>So why?</i>

11:11.560 --> 11:12.920
<i>Why?</i>

11:16.570 --> 11:18.120
Let's go!

11:18.700 --> 11:20.310
Let's go!

11:27.680 --> 11:29.750
You were afraid

11:30.630 --> 11:33.200
that you might someday surpass me.

11:35.490 --> 11:40.440
And I never forgave you for holding back.

11:41.920 --> 11:44.720
But even more than that, 
I couldn't forgive myself

11:45.330 --> 11:48.550
for failing to make you Honki.

11:55.330 --> 11:58.760
Sorry... for making you wait so long.

11:59.330 --> 12:02.530
Here I go, Ichiya!

12:05.010 --> 12:07.540
Come, Senya!

12:38.260 --> 12:39.370
Ichiya.

12:41.340 --> 12:42.880
Senya...

12:43.940 --> 12:49.920
Finally... I got to fight the true, Honki you.

12:55.880 --> 12:57.050
Ichiya?

13:01.060 --> 13:02.340
Ichiya!

13:09.400 --> 13:12.810
Now I will defeat Arajin.

13:12.810 --> 13:16.320
Impossible! Did he absorb Ichiya?!

13:26.250 --> 13:29.040
<i>Wh-What strength.</i>

13:30.060 --> 13:31.330
<i>He'll kill me!</i>

13:36.630 --> 13:40.600
<i>Damn it. I've run out of strength.</i>

13:41.740 --> 13:45.540
<i>Am I... really gonna die?</i>

14:06.650 --> 14:07.870
<i>Die?</i>

14:12.620 --> 14:15.710
<i>There's no way I'm gonna die.</i>

14:16.570 --> 14:18.830
<i>Not here.</i>

14:19.390 --> 14:21.760
<i>Not like this!</i>

14:25.340 --> 14:30.420
I want to lose my virginity!

14:33.850 --> 14:35.100
Arajin!

14:35.100 --> 14:36.500
I told you, right?

14:36.500 --> 14:38.660
I'm not going to die.

14:39.110 --> 14:41.460
What in the world is happening?

14:44.610 --> 14:46.490
Evening, fellas.

14:46.490 --> 14:49.930
But his mom told us not to mess it up!

14:49.930 --> 14:52.500
You want me to just suck 
on my thumb and watch?

14:55.350 --> 14:56.400
Hey, wait!

14:56.400 --> 14:57.540
Hold up, Ryu-chan!

15:01.550 --> 15:04.420
Is that... Matakara?

15:04.760 --> 15:07.860
He absorbed Ichiya, 
and it amplified his power.

15:07.860 --> 15:08.930
Be careful.

15:10.150 --> 15:11.160
Here he comes!

15:15.520 --> 15:17.530
What incredible power!

15:17.530 --> 15:19.940
If he lands any real hits, 
we don't have a chance!

15:40.360 --> 15:43.460
<i>If he keeps this up, we're dead.</i>

15:51.940 --> 15:53.970
I am stronger

15:54.850 --> 15:56.480
than anyone.

16:01.900 --> 16:05.190
Arajin, stay down! Don't get up!

16:06.690 --> 16:11.000
Why do you need to get so strong?

16:12.450 --> 16:16.380
If I get strong, I don't need anything else.

16:16.380 --> 16:20.000
If I don't get strong, 
the monster won't disappear!

16:26.440 --> 16:30.050
Monster? That's what you are now.

16:31.800 --> 16:33.300
Y-You're wrong!

16:33.700 --> 16:36.780
What are you so afraid of?

16:40.130 --> 16:42.370
No, no, no, no!

16:42.370 --> 16:46.530
I don't need friends, 
or my brother, or even you!

16:46.890 --> 16:49.440
I don't need anyone!

16:52.230 --> 16:53.450
<i>So that's it.</i>

16:55.360 --> 16:58.820
<i>All this time, you were scared</i>

16:59.960 --> 17:01.620
<i>of being alone.</i>

17:02.170 --> 17:03.880
<i>And I saw that...</i>

17:04.370 --> 17:06.900
<i>and ran away from you.</i>

17:09.880 --> 17:13.910
<i>Matakara... I won't run anymore.</i>

17:15.560 --> 17:18.940
<i>Not from myself or from you.</i>

18:45.410 --> 18:48.040
He's finally become one.

18:48.420 --> 18:50.060
A Honki Person.

18:52.320 --> 18:53.490
Arajin.

18:55.110 --> 18:57.120
You taught me

18:58.170 --> 19:01.190
what being Honki really means.

19:04.380 --> 19:07.780
Whoo! I really wanna fight you!

19:07.780 --> 19:09.540
Let's go, man! Let's go, man!

19:09.540 --> 19:13.630
Cut it out! I'm never gonna fight again.

19:17.190 --> 19:19.460
See you, Arajin.

19:22.640 --> 19:23.850
Senya?

19:34.490 --> 19:35.770
Matakara.

19:39.570 --> 19:42.880
Ara-chan... I...

19:44.780 --> 19:48.420
Idiot. You're not alone.

19:48.420 --> 19:50.150
Hey!

19:50.150 --> 19:52.280
Matakara!

19:53.480 --> 19:54.420
Also...

20:02.180 --> 20:05.180
<b>Ma</b>

20:02.180 --> 20:05.180
Ara

20:02.180 --> 20:05.180
Jin

20:02.180 --> 20:05.180
<b>Takara</b>

20:06.220 --> 20:07.300
Right?

20:15.400 --> 20:16.440
Yeah.

20:23.490 --> 20:25.500
<b>Searching for Jasmine-chan!</b>

21:11.170 --> 21:12.920
<b>Searching 
for Jasmine-chan!</b>

21:15.920 --> 21:17.420
<i>The Mew Face You've Waited For</i>

21:15.920 --> 21:17.420
Oolong

21:15.920 --> 21:17.420
<b>Now Only</b>

21:15.920 --> 21:17.420
<b>Just 1,000 Yen</b>

21:24.430 --> 21:26.430
<b><b>Chu~ Chu~ Chinese Restaurant</b></b>

21:26.430 --> 21:28.180
<b>Reserved Today</b>

21:26.430 --> 21:28.180
<b>Congrats on 
your recovery!</b>

21:34.190 --> 21:35.690
<b>Ken-san,       Marito-kun</b>

21:34.190 --> 21:35.690
<b>Congratulations on Your Release from the Hospital!!</b>

21:53.610 --> 21:56.610
My name is Ara-teen.

21:56.610 --> 21:59.210
It's excite time!

21:59.590 --> 22:04.220
I can pull this off! It's gonna make 
Mahoro-chan weak in the knees.

22:08.220 --> 22:11.730
Arajin! Your Chu Chu gyoza is ready!

22:11.730 --> 22:14.900
<b>Chu~ Chu~ Chinese Restaurant</b>

22:11.730 --> 22:14.900
I told you I didn't want gyoza for breakfast!

22:22.740 --> 22:25.450
Ouch! Damn it, Senya!

22:25.450 --> 22:27.920
Huh? Senya?

22:27.920 --> 22:29.330
Who the hell is that?

22:29.650 --> 22:32.130
Er... never mind.

22:32.130 --> 22:33.730
Let's go eat!

23:06.190 --> 23:08.300
There's no trace of him.

23:14.180 --> 23:19.000
You show up uninvited, then 
leave without saying anything?

23:19.730 --> 23:22.600
You listening, Senya?

23:39.990 --> 23:41.400
Ow!

23:41.980 --> 23:44.740
What the hell, man?

23:45.050 --> 23:46.210
You called?
